# Only relevant to `gcloud builds submit` from this directory -- it has no
# effect on `docker build` (which uses .dockerignore, or its own COPY
# instructions) or on git. Without this, gcloud has no ignore file to fall
# back to from *this* directory specifically (it doesn't walk up to the
# repo root's .gitignore), so it uploads everything here as the Cloud
# Build source tarball -- confirmed directly: node_modules included, the
# tarball was 400-500+ MiB and the upload alone took several minutes.

.git/
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
dist/
frontend/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
